OL,4,C'Resilient' cat's return inspires      
OL,5,Ckitten nursery                         
OL,6,GThe safe return of a "resilient" cat   
OL,7,Gwho was found 160 miles away from home 
OL,8,Gwith two young kittens has inspired a  
OL,9,Gnew nursery shelter at an animal       
OL,10,Gcharity.                               
OL,12,FMini and her kitties turned up at a    
OL,13,Fgarden shed in Darlington about 14     
OL,14,Fmonths after she disappeared from      
OL,15,FStoke-on-Trent on 30 March last year.  
OL,17,FThe trio were taken in by National     
OL,18,FAnimal Sanctuary Support League        
OL,19,F(NASSL) in Hunwick, near Bishop        
OL,20,FAuckland, who had her microchip        
OL,21,Fscanned and were able to reunite her   
OL,22,Fwith her owner.                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
