OL,4,CRoad closure for 'essential' gas pipe  
OL,5,Creplacement                            
OL,6,G"Essential" work to replace ageing     
OL,7,Gmetal gas pipes with more durable      
OL,8,Gplastic ones will see a partial road   
OL,9,Gclosure.                               
OL,11,FNorthern Gas Networks is starting      
OL,12,Fnearly three months of works on        
OL,13,FBrotton, Saltburn-by-the-Sea, on 30    
OL,14,FNovember.                              
OL,16,FA one-way road closure will be in      
OL,17,Fplace starting from the Brotton Road/  
OL,18,FA174 roundabout towards Brotton High   
OL,19,FStreet for up to three weeks.          
OL,21,FThe site will then be cleared for two  
OL,22,Fweeks over Christmas.             G2/4 
