OL,4,CProposal to turn closed nightclub into 
OL,5,Cflats                                  
OL,6,GPlans have been lodged to convert a    
OL,7,Gformer coastal clubbing hotspot into   
OL,8,Gflats, just over two months after the  
OL,9,Gnews of its closure.                   
OL,11,FProposals to convert the ex-nightclub  
OL,12,FHavana, in Whitley Bay, into six flats 
OL,13,Fhave been handed to North Tyneside     
OL,14,FCouncil.                               
OL,16,FThe application outlines a bid for     
OL,17,Fthree two-bedroom and three one-       
OL,18,Fbedroom apartments at the South Parade 
OL,19,Fsite, and comes after Havana - which   
OL,20,Fopened in the 2000s - closed its doors 
OL,21,Ffor the final time in September.       
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
